{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":163948,"duration_api_ms":214105,"num_turns":9,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"cc3d7f7b-335f-4225-a1d9-bea1bc80d784","total_cost_usd":0.8686343000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":50876,"cache_read_input_tokens":225465,"output_tokens":2543,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":50876,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":110,"outputTokens":7949,"cacheReadInputTokens":875918,"cacheCreationInputTokens":56736,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1983668,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":13,"outputTokens":3946,"cacheReadInputTokens":275505,"cacheCreationInputTokens":69408,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6702675,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"approved","evidence":["Provenance schema implemented in crates/tank_core/src/types/provenance.rs with ConfidenceLevel enum (Literature, Expert, Heuristic, Placeholder), ParamMeta struct (unit, source, confidence, valid_range, notes — all optional), RangeWarning struct, check_param_range(), check_all_ranges(), and format_param() functions.","All types publicly exported via tank_core::types::mod.rs (line 47-49) and re-exported via tank_data::lib.rs (lines 11-13) for external consumption.","ProcessParamsPreset in tank_data/src/presets.rs carries both preset-level Provenance (source_title, source_year, confidence, notes) and per-parameter BTreeMap<String, ParamMeta> with #[serde(default, skip_serializing_if)] for backward compatibility.","ParamMeta uses #[serde(deny_unknown_fields)] to catch typos in metadata fields. ProcessParamsPreset::validate() rejects unknown param_meta keys via unknown_param_meta_keys() + param_value() lookup against all 56 parameters.","check_ranges() method on ProcessParamsPreset produces Vec<RangeWarning> (informational, not load failure) by delegating to check_all_ranges() — meeting the 'warning not error' requirement.","format_param() produces developer-facing output like 'K_s_aob: 0.5 mg N/L [literature, EPA 2013] range [0.1, 5.0] notes: biofilter context' — satisfying the display helper requirement.","All 6 required acceptance-criteria tests present and passing: test_provenance_schema_roundtrip (AC1), test_provenance_optional_fields (AC2), test_confidence_levels_enum (AC3), test_valid_range_enforcement (AC4), test_backward_compatible_loading (AC5), test_provenance_display (AC6), plus test_unknown_param_meta_keys_are_rejected as a bonus guard.","9 provenance unit tests pass in tank_core (--lib provenance), 13 tests pass in tank_data (--lib), and 50 integration tests pass across budget_tracking/budget_helpers/shrimp_population.","SUB_ADULT_FEEDING_WEIGHT constant consolidated to single definition (0.67) in biology.rs, imported by shrimp.rs — no more divergent values.","RemoveShrimp reserve fraction now uses adults_before_removal as denominator instead of total_count(), fixing the dilution bug.","load_process_params() in lib.rs calls preset.validate() which now includes unknown param_meta key rejection, completing the data loading integration."],"findings_or_gaps":["No TOML data files currently contain [param_meta.*] sections — the infrastructure is ready but no parameters have provenance metadata attached yet. This is expected for this bead; actual metadata attachment is the deliverable of tanksim-6e5.7.2 (the downstream dependent).","Preset-level Provenance.confidence is typed as Option<String> rather than Option<ConfidenceLevel> enum, creating a minor inconsistency between preset-level and parameter-level confidence typing. Not a blocker since they serve different granularity levels, but worth noting for future alignment.","The schema currently only supports per-parameter provenance on ProcessParamsPreset. Other preset types (SourceWater, Substrate, Plant, Shrimp, Scenario) have preset-level Provenance but not per-parameter ParamMeta. This is acceptable for the current scope since process parameters are the highest-value target."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"a79dcd63-6109-48a9-a30f-f492894c43a9"}
